# Copy to backend/.env and edit.

# --- AI (optional) ---
# Works with Anthropic directly, or any Anthropic-compatible provider (e.g. DeepSeek).
# DeepSeek example:
#   AI_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com/anthropic
#   AI_MODEL=deepseek-v4-flash
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-deepseek-api-key
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# AI_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5
# AI_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com/anthropic
# Summary jobs use a separate temporary directory and worker pool.
# SUMMARY_JOB_DIR=/absolute/path/to/summary-jobs
# SUMMARY_JOB_TTL_SECONDS=3600
# AI_MAX_WORKERS=1
# AI_MAX_QUEUED_JOBS=10
# Captions are preferred. On the first captionless summary, faster-whisper
# downloads the selected model to its local cache. Allow network access, startup
# time, CPU, RAM, and cache disk space; one AI worker is the safe CPU default.
# WHISPER_MODEL=small
# WHISPER_DEVICE=cpu
# WHISPER_COMPUTE_TYPE=int8

# --- Pro tokens ---
# Set this to keep issued Pro tokens valid across restarts.
PRO_SECRET=change-me-to-a-long-random-string
# REDEEM_CODES=VIDEO-PRO-2026,STUDENT-VIP,KIRO-UNLOCK
# PRO_TOKEN_TTL_DAYS=30

# --- Limits ---
# FREE_MAX_HEIGHT=720
# PRO_MAX_HEIGHT=2160
# FREE_BATCH_LIMIT=1
# PRO_BATCH_LIMIT=20
# MAX_FILESIZE_MB=2048
# MAX_DURATION_SECONDS=14400
# RATE_LIMIT_MAX=20
# RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_SECONDS=300
# MAX_WORKERS=4
# JOB_TTL_SECONDS=3600

# --- Sites needing login ---
# Netscape-format cookies.txt ONLY. A JSON cookie export will be rejected.
# COOKIE_FILE=/path/to/cookies.txt

# --- Networking ---
# CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000

# DEV ONLY. Leave unset in production.
# Needed only where DNS maps public sites into ranges Python calls private
# (this dev sandbox resolves youtube.com into 198.18.0.0/15, RFC 2544).
# ALLOW_RESOLVED_NETS=198.18.0.0/15
